    "body": "@mfreed7 I was reading through [your comment above](https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/910#issuecomment-718159329) and I'm not sure I understand how this meaningfully differs from a `<link>` tag.\r\n\r\nI understand that this (1) helps avoid duplication of `<style>` tags, (2) helps avoid making unnecessary fetches for small stylesheets that would be better inlined, and (3) can adapt to changes made to `<style>` tags. But I'm unclear on the benefit of this vs larger external stylesheets that rarely change (if ever).",
